# A subagent that errors: its panel row turns red (subagents.go's
# renderSubagentRow, status "error" -> KilnRed/G().Fail), and the parent's
# own turn continues (task.go: a dispatch error becomes a tool result
# text, not a failed parent turn), so the panel commits with a done+error
# row rather than hanging.
@faux testdata/faux/qa/tools-subagent-error.yaml
@fixture testdata/behaviour/qa/model-roles-fast-heavy
@args --permission-mode acceptEdits

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
TYPE check the deploy config with a subagent
KEY enter
WAITFOR /subagents? finished/ 20
SHOT subagent-error-row
EXPECT /1 subagents? finished/
EXPECT /✕/
EXPECT /boom, subagent misbehaved|Subagent .*failed/
WAITFOR /I'll check the deploy config myself instead/ 20
SHOT subagent-error-committed
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
